{{Passive skill box|Unwavering Crusade}}
'''Unwavering Crusade''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Guardian]] that grants a chance to [[trigger]] [[Summon Elemental Relic]] when you or your [[Ally|allies]] kills a monster or hits a rare or unique monster.

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.23.0|
* {{Ruthless}} Elemental Relics, triggered by the Guardian's Unwavering Crusade Ascendancy Passive Skill, now have a maximum level of 80 (previously 85).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.22.0|
* Reworked. Old mods listed below:
** {{c|mod|Nearby Allies have 20% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed}}
** {{c|mod|Nearby Allies have 30% increased Area of Effect}}
** {{c|mod|Nearby Allies Intimidate Enemies for 4 seconds on Hit}}
** {{c|mod|Nearby Allies Unnerve Enemies for 4 seconds on Hit}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.13.0|
* No longer causes you to grant Nearby Allies 30% increased Damage.
* Now causes you to grant Nearby Allies 20% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed (from 15%).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.8.0|
* Has been reworked: Now grants nearby allies 30% increased damage, 15% increased attack, cast and movement speed, 30% increased area of effect, and causes nearby allies to Intimidate and Unnerve Enemies for 4 seconds on hit. Enemies which are Unnerved take 10% increased Spell Damage.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.4.0|
* Added a new notable which requires Radiant Crusade -- Unwavering Crusade: Summoned Sentinels use Crusade Slam, 100% increased Minion Accuracy Rating, Minions Intimidate Enemies for 4 seconds on Hit, and if you've Hit an Enemy Recently, you and nearby Allies Regenerate 3% of Life per second. The passive leading to this notable grants 14% increased Armour, 6% increased Maximum Energy Shield, and Minions deal 10% increased Damage.
}}
{{Version history table end}}


